Comment: 1,0:00:01.23,0:00:04.11,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\a6}"You are invited to an anonymous online meetup\Nexclusively for romance-bot owners."
Comment: 1,0:00:04.11,0:00:05.69,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\a6}"On the day of the event, please enter using\Nthe URL below."
Comment: 1,0:00:09.95,0:00:11.32,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"ENTER"
Dialogue: 99,0:00:01.72,0:00:04.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}An email from an unknown sender...
Dialogue: 99,0:00:05.03,0:00:09.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1\q2}If I attend, maybe I can find out \Nwhere Nadeshiko came from?
Dialogue: 99,0:00:16.32,0:00:17.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You made it!
Dialogue: 99,0:00:17.80,0:00:20.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome to the owners' meetup!
Dialogue: 99,0:00:22.88,0:00:23.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 99,0:00:28.59,0:00:33.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}This feels so normal!
Dialogue: 99,0:00:33.91,0:00:36.97,Default,,0,0,0,,So is yours a girl too, Miaka?{sgt: the anime doesn't even get a moment to explain where "Miaka" even comes from.}
Dialogue: 99,0:00:36.97,0:00:38.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Y-Yeah.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:38.85,0:00:40.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Mine too.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:41.06,0:00:44.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Check out this super cute pic of her.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:44.46,0:00:45.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 99,0:00:45.88,0:00:48.42,Default,,0,0,0,,What sort of girl is yours, Miaka?
Dialogue: 99,0:00:50.07,0:00:52.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, her name is Nadeshiko.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:52.52,0:00:55.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Is she really a robot?
Dialogue: 99,0:00:55.67,0:00:59.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Her body doesn't have any mechanical parts at all.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:59.02,0:00:59.49,Default,,0,0,0,,It's as if—
Dialogue: 99,0:00:59.49,0:01:00.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Miaka!
Dialogue: 99,0:01:01.52,0:01:02.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 99,0:01:02.84,0:01:06.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Nadeshiko looks absolutely adorable.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:06.30,0:01:08.34,Default,,0,0,0,,It's like she might start talking any second.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:08.71,0:01:12.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but most models aren't great at chatting.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:16.10,0:01:18.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Wait, then Nadeshiko
Dialogue: 99,0:01:18.62,0:01:21.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}isn't an ordinary android after all!
Dialogue: 99,0:01:26.43,0:01:28.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I didn't learn jack!
Dialogue: 99,0:01:29.33,0:01:31.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But worst of all,
Dialogue: 99,0:01:32.23,0:01:37.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1\q2}I was apparently the only one perverted enough \Nto actually fuck her android.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:39.28,0:01:42.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd hoped to learn a little more about Nadeshiko.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:43.10,0:01:45.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I could tell you all sorts of things if you'd like.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:46.86,0:01:48.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Like, for instance...
Dialogue: 99,0:01:48.97,0:01:50.30,Default,,0,0,0,,...about your body.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:52.98,0:01:54.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Akane...
Dialogue: 99,0:01:54.39,0:01:56.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}What's going on? Why are there two of her?
Dialogue: 99,0:01:57.72,0:02:00.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Is she secretly a ninja-bot?!
Dialogue: 99,0:02:01.54,0:02:02.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Akane...
Dialogue: 99,0:02:04.19,0:02:06.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I love you.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:07.23,0:02:09.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I can't explain it,
Dialogue: 99,0:02:09.44,0:02:13.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}but her whispering in both my ears feels so good.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:14.03,0:02:17.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You said you wanted to know more about me.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:17.18,0:02:21.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\q2}So I thought I'd introduce some \NVR features you haven't seen yet.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:22.53,0:02:24.96,Default,,0,0,0,,The black dress one is virtual?
Dialogue: 99,0:02:26.46,0:02:28.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Exactly.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:28.40,0:02:30.84,Default,,0,0,0,,The sensation of being licked,
Dialogue: 99,0:02:31.21,0:02:33.05,Default,,0,0,0,,and being sucked,
Dialogue: 99,0:02:34.13,0:02:36.86,Default,,0,0,0,,are replicated with near-perfect accuracy.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:38.96,0:02:42.73,Default,,0,0,0,,See? I'm not actually touching you anywhere.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:43.18,0:02:46.17,Default,,0,0,0,,But it's not enough for me to just sit and watch.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:46.17,0:02:47.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait! I—
Dialogue: 99,0:02:49.65,0:02:52.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's the same old tricks again!
Dialogue: 99,0:02:58.83,0:02:59.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Akane?
Dialogue: 99,0:03:01.10,0:03:04.68,Default,,0,0,0,,What were the other androids like?
Dialogue: 99,0:03:04.68,0:03:07.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I got some photos. Want to see?
Dialogue: 99,0:03:07.63,0:03:08.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, please.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:13.36,0:03:14.68,Default,,0,0,0,,This image...
Dialogue: 99,0:03:18.30,0:03:21.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder if she noticed my hidden message.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:22.22,0:03:25.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I haven't seen Nadeshiko in so long.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:25.79,0:03:28.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm looking forward to it.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:31.82,0:01:37.41,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\shad0\blur1\q2\fs40\frz15.79\fn123Marker\c&HCE3677&\3c&HFFFFFF&\pos(1029.26,131.08)}Our doll hobby escalated into \Na humanoid robot obsession.
